@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@systemApiKey = local-dev-system-key

### Deep health check — expect 200 Healthy JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Login as seeded Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### Trigger maintenance as Admin — expect snapshotsRecorded / purgedRecords / suspendedTenants
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/system/trigger-maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Health after maintenance — worker lastSuccess should be recent
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Trigger maintenance with system API key (no JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/system/trigger-maintenance
X-System-Api-Key: {{systemApiKey}}

### Trigger again immediately — may return 409 if still overlapping, or 200 with snapshotsRecorded=0
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/system/trigger-maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Unauthorized trigger — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/system/trigger-maintenance

### Simulate PastDue webhook (grace testing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "invoice.payment_failed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "in_failed_1",
      "customer": "cus_mock_acme",
      "subscription": "sub_mock_acme",
      "metadata": {
        "tenant_id": "{{adminLogin.response.body.$.tenantId}}"
      }
    }
  }
}
